---
DD-S006 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-S006)

  × `match[0].vid` = 73872 is above the maximum (65535)
    ╭─[18-vid-too-large.yaml:12:10]
 11 │   - bus: usb
 12 │     vid: 0x12090
    ·          ───┬───
    ·             ╰── out of range
 13 │     pid: 0x0001
    ╰────
  help: the value must fit in 16 bits (0x0000–0xFFFF); check for an extra digit
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[18-vid-too-large.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
